<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly vegoil/subproduct shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat November subproduct shipment figures, followed by January to November totals, in tonnes, (year-earlier in brackets):</p>
<p> Soymeal plts    829,881  (601,299)  7,800,360  (6,215,456)</p>
<p> Sunseed plts    142,196  (157,730)  1,814,944  (1,799,215)</p>
<p> Cotton plts	11,364   (13,410)    228,713    (254,479)</p>
<p> Linseed expls	 nil	(nil)    110,604    (100,412)</p>
<p> Groundnut plts    8,802   (18,991)     51,151     (65,849)</p>
<p> Other plt/expl   56,310   (10,867)    224,911    (221,859)</p>
<p> Soybean oil     197,774  (185,396)  1,553,570  (1,319,697)</p>
<p>    Sunoil	 121,143    (63,408) 1,284,121   (1,214,071)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in November were as follows (tonnes):</p>
<p>SOYPELLETS: China 234,088; Italy 124,510; Iran 109,326</p>
<p>SUNPELLETS: Holland 59,451; Britain 19,378; South Africa 13,485</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0666))</p>
